      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then came near the heads of fathers’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of the Levites unto Eleazar the priest, and unto Joshua the son of Nun, and unto the heads of fathers’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of the tribes of the children of Israel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and they spake unto them at Shiloh in the land of Canaan, saying, Jehovah commanded by Moses to give us cities to dwell in, with the suburbs thereof for our cattle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the children of Israel gave unto the Levites out of their inheritance, according to the commandment of Jehovah, these cities with their suburbs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the lot came out for the families of the Kohathites: and the children of Aaron the priest, who were of the Levites, had by lot out of the tribe of Judah, and out of the tribe of the Simeonites, and out of the tribe of Benjamin, thirteen cities.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the rest of the children of Kohath had by lot out of the families of the tribe of Ephraim, and out of the tribe of Dan, and out of the half-tribe of Manasseh, ten cities.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the children of Gershon had by lot out of the families of the tribe of Issachar, and out of the tribe of Asher, and out of the tribe of Naphtali, and out of the half-tribe of Manasseh in Bashan, thirteen cities.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The children of Merari according to their families had out of the tribe of Reuben, and out of the tribe of Gad, and out of the tribe of Zebulun, twelve cities.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the children of Israel gave by lot unto the Levites these cities with their suburbs, as Jehovah commanded by Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they gave out of the tribe of the children of Judah, and out of the tribe of the children of Simeon, these cities which are ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mentioned by name: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and they were for the children of Aaron, of the families of the Kohathites, who were of the children of Levi; for theirs was the first lot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they gave them Kiriath-arba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the father of Anak (the same is Hebron), in the hill-country of Judah, with the suburbs thereof round about it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the fields of the city, and the villages thereof, gave they to Caleb the son of Jephunneh for his possession.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And unto the children of Aaron the priest they gave Hebron with its suburbs, the city of refuge for the manslayer, and Libnah with its suburbs, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Jattir with its suburbs, and Eshtemoa with its suburbs, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Holon with its suburbs, and Debir with its suburbs, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Ain with its suburbs, and Juttah with its suburbs, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Beth-shemesh with its suburbs; nine cities out of those two tribes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And out of the tribe of Benjamin, Gibeon with its suburbs, Geba with its suburbs, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anathoth with its suburbs, and Almon with its suburbs; four cities. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the cities of the children of Aaron, the priests, were thirteen cities with their suburbs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the families of the children of Kohath, the Levites, even the rest of the children of Kohath, they had the cities of their lot out of the tribe of Ephraim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they gave them Shechem with its suburbs in the hill-country of Ephraim, the city of refuge for the manslayer, and Gezer with its suburbs, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Kibzaim with its suburbs, and Beth-horon with its suburbs; four cities. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And out of the tribe of Dan, Elteke with its suburbs, Gibbethon with its suburbs, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aijalon with its suburbs, Gath-rimmon with its suburbs; four cities. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And out of the half-tribe of Manasseh, Taanach with its suburbs, and Gath-rimmon with its suburbs; two cities. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the cities of the families of the rest of the children of Kohath were ten with their suburbs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And unto the children of Gershon, of the families of the Levites, out of the half-tribe of Manasseh ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
